@startuml CloudWarehouse_Sequence_Waybill_Dual_Track
title Waybill Preview Dual-Track Pricing\n(Class & Object Level — maps to source code)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Warehouse Admin" as User
participant "ui : index.html" as UI
participant "bc : BillController" as BC
participant "importSvc : BillImportService" as BIS
participant "WaybillExcelHelper\n{static}" as Excel
participant "row : WaybillImportRow" as row
participant "dualCalc : DualTrackFeeCalculator" as Dual
participant "costSvc : PriceRuleCalculateService" as CostSvc
participant "quoteSvc : CustomerQuoteCalculateService" as QuoteSvc
participant "feeEngine : FeeCalculationEngine" as Fee
participant "resolver : DefaultBillingStrategyResolver" as Resolver
participant "tier : TierBillingStrategy" as Tier
participant "BillLineTotals\n{static}" as Totals
database "db : SqlConnection\n(SQL Server)" as DB

User -> UI : select waybill Excel\nclick Preview
UI -> BC : PreviewWaybills(file)\nPOST /api/Bill/waybill/preview
activate BC

BC -> BIS : ProcessImportAsync(stream,\nsaveToDatabase=false)
activate BIS

BIS -> Excel : ReadWaybills(stream)
activate Excel
note right of Excel
  Class: WaybillExcelHelper
  Parses dual-row header
  (账单明细 + 成本明细)
  or standard template
end note
Excel --> BIS : parsed : WaybillImportResult
deactivate Excel

BIS -> DB : QueryAsync Sites, Destinations,\nCustomers, CustomerAccounts,\nPriceRule counts
activate DB
DB --> BIS : siteByCode, destinations,\naccounts, customersByCode
deactivate DB

loop foreach row in parsed.Rows
  note over row : current object:\nrow : WaybillImportRow

  BIS -> row : ValidateRow()
  alt row.ErrorMessage set
    note over row : e.g. empty province
  else row valid
    BIS -> row : ApplyWeightRounding()\nvia WeightRounding.RoundForForwardBilling
    BIS -> row : resolve CustomerId\nResolveSite / ResolveDestination

    BIS -> Dual : CalculateAsync(row)
    activate Dual

    == Payable track (应付 / PriceRules) ==
    Dual -> CostSvc : CalculateAsync(\nPriceCalculateRequest)
    activate CostSvc
    CostSvc -> DB : SELECT FROM PriceRules\nWHERE SiteId, DestId,\nEffectiveDate <= BillDate
    activate DB
    DB --> CostSvc : List PriceRule
    deactivate DB

    CostSvc -> Fee : Calculate(rules, weight, orderDate)
    activate Fee
    Fee -> Fee : filter active rules\nby EffectiveDate / ExpiryDate
    Fee -> Resolver : Resolve(BillingContext)
    activate Resolver
    Resolver --> Fee : tier : IBillingStrategy\n(first CanHandle)
    deactivate Resolver
    Fee -> Tier : Calculate(context)
    activate Tier
    Tier --> Fee : PriceCalculateResult
    deactivate Tier
    Fee --> CostSvc : payable result
    deactivate Fee
    CostSvc --> Dual : row.PayableTransitFee,\nrow.PayableTotal
    deactivate CostSvc

    == Receivable track (应收 / CustomerQuoteRules) ==
    Dual -> QuoteSvc : CalculateAsync(\nCustomerQuoteCalculateRequest)
    activate QuoteSvc
    QuoteSvc -> DB : SELECT FROM CustomerQuoteRules\nWHERE CustomerId,\nEffectiveDate <= BillDate
    activate DB
    DB --> QuoteSvc : List CustomerQuoteRule
    deactivate DB

    QuoteSvc -> QuoteSvc : CalculateFromRules(...)\nmap via CustomerQuoteRuleMapper
    QuoteSvc -> Fee : Calculate(priceRules,\nweight, orderDate)
    activate Fee
    Fee -> Resolver : Resolve(BillingContext)
    Resolver --> Fee : tier : IBillingStrategy
    Fee -> Tier : Calculate(context)
    Tier --> Fee : PriceCalculateResult
    Fee --> QuoteSvc : receivable result
    deactivate Fee
    QuoteSvc --> Dual : row.ReceivableTransitFee,\nrow.ReceivableTotal
    deactivate QuoteSvc

    Dual -> Totals : CalcReceivableGrandTotal(row)\nCalcPayableGrandTotal(row)\nCalcRemainingReceivable/Payable(row)
    activate Totals
    Dual -> Totals : ApplyComparison(row)
    note right of Totals
      Static helpers on BillLineTotals
      Compare machine vs Excel L/X
      tolerance 0.01 -> TransitFeeMatched
    end note
    deactivate Totals

    Dual --> BIS : row filled\n(profit + match flags)
    deactivate Dual
  end
end

BIS --> BC : WaybillImportResult\n(matched / mismatch counts)
deactivate BIS
BC --> UI : ApiResponse WaybillImportResult
deactivate BC
UI --> User : preview table:\n应收/应付 机器值 vs 表内值

@enduml

' Presentation (EN):
' 1. Class-and-object sequence: lifelines are instances (bc: BillController, row: WaybillImportRow), not generic layers.
' 2. BillImportService enriches each row; DualTrackFeeCalculator runs payable and receivable via FeeCalculationEngine + DefaultBillingStrategyResolver + TierBillingStrategy.
' 3. BillLineTotals.ApplyComparison flags match/mismatch against spreadsheet L/X columns.
